<p begin="00:40:40.333" end="00:40:43.533" style="s2">You decide. I&#39;m not gonna beg you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.366" end="00:40:45.600" style="s2">Don&#39;t take my word for it,</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.600" end="00:40:46.500" style="s2">and don&#39;t take hers.</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.566" end="00:40:49.200" style="s2">Go see who she is when she thinks</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.200" end="00:40:50.566" style="s2">nobody important is listening.</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.933" end="00:40:54.200" style="s2">Then get up in that courtroom and tell the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.733" end="00:40:56.666" style="s2">Whatever you say,</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.666" end="00:40:58.800" style="s2">you&#39;re still my son.</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.966" end="00:41:11.066" style="s2">That was Kessler.</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.533" end="00:41:13.933" style="s2">Craig&#39;s new lawyer is talking to the district attorney.</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.166" end="00:41:15.166" style="s2">Talking about what?</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.966" end="00:41:16.766" style="s2">About me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.366" end="00:41:20.400" style="s2">All we have left is the son.</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.966" end="00:41:22.500" style="s2">Without him, we&#39;re finished.</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.933" end="00:41:24.600" style="s2">And so is this house.</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.366" end="00:41:33.700" style="s2">We need to talk. Just the two of us.&quot; Gabriel. I cry, he says yes.</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.200" end="00:41:35.266" style="s2">He always has.</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.133" end="00:41:42.333" style="s2">I know you hate me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.766" end="00:41:44.466" style="s2">But I never wanted to hurt her.</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.866" end="00:41:46.933" style="s2">I just want us to go back to the way we were.</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.133" end="00:41:49.300" style="s2">If I tell the judge she can&#39;t manage her own affairs...</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.366" end="00:41:51.500" style="s2">what happens to her?</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.766" end="00:41:54.066" style="s2">She&#39;ll be taken care of.</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.366" end="00:41:55.666" style="s2">And you&#39;ll handle the rest.</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.066" end="00:41:57.333" style="s2">If you want me on your side,</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.333" end="00:41:58.366" style="s2">then spell it out.</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.400" end="00:42:01.533" style="s2">I become her guardian—then what?</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.933" end="00:42:03.266" style="s2">The house? My mother?</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.866" end="00:42:04.966" style="s2">And don&#39;t sweet-talk me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.966" end="00:42:06.300" style="s2">I&#39;ve had enough of that this month.</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.933" end="00:42:10.266" style="s2">Okay. I&#39;ll tell the court what I really believe.</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.300" end="00:42:21.100" style="s2">I saw them. A café on the River Walk.</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.566" end="00:42:22.866" style="s2">She was holding his hand,</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.133" end="00:42:24.466" style="s2">and he didn&#39;t pull away.</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.933" end="00:42:27.533" style="s2">That boy of yours is gonna bury you, Lucia.</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.200" end="00:42:29.700" style="s2">He&#39;s on their witness list.</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.933" end="00:42:35.200" style="s2">I told my son to decide for himself.</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.200" end="00:42:37.733" style="s2">I&#39;m not taking that back just</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.733" end="00:42:39.166" style="s2">because I&#39;m afraid of the answer.</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.100" end="00:42:42.200" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll be in that courtroom tomorrow, too.</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.500" end="00:42:44.966" style="s2">So will I. I&#39;ll bring my heart pills.</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.800" end="00:42:55.300" style="s2">Your Honor, Mr. Benson&#39;s testimony is withdrawn.</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.100" end="00:42:57.333" style="s2">But the facts remain.</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.200" end="00:43:00.400" style="s2">A woman fresh out of heart surgery,</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.133" end="00:43:02.600" style="s2">confused on her discharge papers,</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.166" end="00:43:05.200" style="s2">pays a fired waitress&#39;s family</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.200" end="00:43:07.300" style="s2">and secretly buys another family&#39;s debt.</p>
<p begin="00:43:08.533" end="00:43:09.733" style="s2">Withdrawn, Your Honor,</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.133" end="00:43:12.700" style="s2">because under oath at his deposition Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.733" end="00:43:15.866" style="s2">Benson said Richard Beaumont told him what to write—</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.866" end="00:43:17.700" style="s2">the transcript is in your file.</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.200" end="00:43:22.900" style="s2">Doctor, you examined Mrs. Moreno for this court.</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.700" end="00:43:24.866" style="s2">What did you find?</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.333" end="00:43:27.600" style="s2">Her cognition is completely normal.</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.000" end="00:43:31.000" style="s2">The tremor is a side effect of her heart medication.</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.733" end="00:43:34.866" style="s2">She counted backward by sevens faster than I could.</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.333" end="00:43:37.100" style="s2">And the doctor who wrote the letter</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.100" end="00:43:39.666" style="s2">in this application never examined her.</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.566" end="00:43:43.533" style="s2">Mrs. Moreno, what&#39;s today&#39;s date?</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.133" end="00:43:45.666" style="s2">Friday, October sixteenth.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.933" end="00:43:47.666" style="s2">How much did you pay for that debt?</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.230" end="00:43:51.171" style="s2">Four hundred twelve thousand five</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.300" end="00:43:52.900" style="s2">hundred. Wired September</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.900" end="00:43:56.866" style="s2">thirtieth, at ten past two in the afternoon. Face value, five</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.866" end="00:44:00.200" style="s2">hundred ninety thousand. A very good deal, counselor.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.766" end="00:44:02.166" style="s2">And why did you buy it?</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.300" end="00:44:05.700" style="s2">Because a young woman poured</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.700" end="00:44:07.066" style="s2">coffee on my head, Your Honor,</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.600" end="00:44:09.533" style="s2">and I wanted to know if she would ever</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.600" end="00:44:11.433" style="s2">apologize to a waitress when nobody was watching.</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.433" end="00:44:12.633" style="s2">She didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.000" end="00:44:16.466" style="s2">That isn&#39;t confusion. It&#39;s a test.</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.000" end="00:44:18.200" style="s2">And she failed it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.500" end="00:44:20.000" style="s2">We call Gabriel Moreno.</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.766" end="00:44:29.900" style="s2">Mom hasn&#39;t seemed right since the surgery.</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.900" end="00:44:31.866" style="s2">I don&#39;t understand the decisions she&#39;s making.</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.866" end="00:44:33.200" style="s2">I&#39;m really worried about her.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.300" end="00:44:34.900" style="s2">Mr. Moreno, did you write this?</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.340" end="00:44:36.540" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.966" end="00:44:38.266" style="s2">Do you believe your mother is</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.266" end="00:44:39.900" style="s2">capable of managing her own affairs?</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.333" end="00:44:41.466" style="s2">When I wrote that,</p>
<p begin="00:44:42.066" end="00:44:43.766" style="s2">someone had spent a week telling me</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.766" end="00:44:45.366" style="s2">my mother was controlling me with her money.</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.266" end="00:44:47.333" style="s2">I believed it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.766" end="00:44:48.766" style="s2">That&#39;s on me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.333" end="00:44:51.200" style="s2">But you&#39;re asking what I believe now.</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.733" end="00:44:55.333" style="s2">I believe she&#39;s the most capable person in this courtroom.</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.666" end="00:45:03.933" style="s2">Two days ago, I asked Miss Beaumont to meet me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.733" end="00:45:06.600" style="s2">She told me to come here today</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.600" end="00:45:08.366" style="s2">and say my mother isn&#39;t fit.</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.766" end="00:45:10.133" style="s2">I recorded that conversation.</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.266" end="00:45:13.066" style="s2">Texas is a one-party consent state.</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.766" end="00:45:14.733" style="s2">I was the party.</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.200" end="00:45:17.000" style="s2">Objection!</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.666" end="00:45:19.366" style="s2">Overruled. Play it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.800" end="00:45:25.533" style="s2">...once you&#39;re her guardian, her money, her company,</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.800" end="00:45:26.700" style="s2">that mortgage—</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.066" end="00:45:28.466" style="s2">you manage all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.600" end="00:45:30.300" style="s2">You never collect on that debt,</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.466" end="00:45:32.000" style="s2">and my dad keeps the house.</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.600" end="00:45:34.400" style="s2">The money for that waitress&#39;s family—</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.933" end="00:45:36.266" style="s2">you just stop it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.133" end="00:45:38.200" style="s2">You keep the company,</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.800" end="00:45:40.933" style="s2">your mom goes to a nice place with a garden.</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.700" end="00:45:42.466" style="s2">By Christmas</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.466" end="00:45:44.133" style="s2">she won&#39;t even remember the coffee.</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.600" end="00:45:49.266" style="s2">He&#39;s taking it out of context—</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.066" end="00:45:52.000" style="s2">I&#39;ve heard all the context I need.</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.700" end="00:45:56.600" style="s2">This court denies the application and dissolves</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.600" end="00:45:59.133" style="s2">the temporary order, effective immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.400" end="00:46:03.166" style="s2">The application was brought in bad faith,</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.166" end="00:46:06.866" style="s2">and the applicant, Mr. Benson, will pay Mrs. Moreno&#39;s attorney&#39;s fees.</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.266" end="00:46:12.400" style="s2">The conduct of Richard Beaumont and Craig Benson is</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.400" end="00:46:14.766" style="s2">referred to the Bexar County District Attorney</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.766" end="00:46:17.700" style="s2">to investigate possible perjury and conspiracy.</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.266" end="00:46:28.266" style="s2">You told me to go see who she is when she</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.266" end="00:46:29.700" style="s2">thinks nobody important is listening.</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.966" end="00:46:32.866" style="s2">She thought the only one listening was me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.766" end="00:46:38.700" style="s2">You&#39;re the one who matters most, mijo.</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.566" end="00:46:43.600" style="s2">Lucia—the house. Please.</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.933" end="00:46:44.900" style="s2">We&#39;ll do anything.</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.533" end="00:46:47.333" style="s2">Vanessa,</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.900" end="00:46:50.566" style="s2">did you ever apologize to Maya</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.566" end="00:46:51.900" style="s2">when nobody was watching?</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.466" end="00:46:56.066" style="s2">Fine. I&#39;m sorry, Maya. Happy now?</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.133" end="00:46:57.366" style="s2">Can we talk about the house?</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.800" end="00:47:01.300" style="s2">An apology isn&#39;t a payment, Miss Beaumont.</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.800" end="00:47:03.666" style="s2">You didn&#39;t come to me because you&#39;re sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.166" end="00:47:06.300" style="s2">You came because you ran out of people to use.</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.533" end="00:47:09.166" style="s2">You only apologize when there&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.166" end="00:47:10.500" style="s2">a crowd watching, Vanessa. Even</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.133" end="00:47:16.000" style="s2">now. Then there&#39;s nothing to talk about. Walter?</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.100" end="00:47:23.666" style="s2">That loan is in default, Mr. Beaumont.</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.100" end="00:47:25.800" style="s2">Pay it in full within thirty days,</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.200" end="00:47:27.733" style="s2">or it goes to foreclosure.</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.100" end="00:47:31.100" style="s2">You&#39;ll die that woman from the market.</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.200" end="00:47:35.466" style="s2">I will. I never stopped being her, Pamela.</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.200" end="00:47:37.266" style="s2">That&#39;s why you lost.</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.333" end="00:47:40.566" style="s2">It was only ever a game—</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.600" end="00:47:41.666" style="s2">It was never a game.</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.500" end="00:47:43.400" style="s2">That&#39;s my son.</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.966" end="00:47:50.200" style="s2">Your suspension is lifted.</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.933" end="00:47:52.533" style="s2">And the management training</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.533" end="00:47:54.100" style="s2">program—we&#39;ll see you Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.500" end="00:48:08.800" style="s2">It&#39;s hot, Mom. Hot. Just right.</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.733" end="00:48:11.600" style="s2">The Beaumont house goes to auction</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.600" end="00:48:13.333" style="s2">the first Tuesday in December.</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.500" end="00:48:19.933" style="s2">Back in rehab—and I made my own breakfast this morning!</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.233" end="00:48:23.866" style="s2">Here comes the Mirabel&#39;s future general manager.</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.533" end="00:48:27.833" style="s2">Let me finish the training first, Mrs. Moreno.</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.133" end="00:48:30.033" style="s2">Four weeks in, and they already gave</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.033" end="00:48:31.100" style="s2">me the Sunday brunch.</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.633" end="00:48:33.733" style="s2">Is this chair taken?</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.066" end="00:48:36.500" style="s2">For you? Never. Sit.</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.733" end="00:48:41.666" style="s2">Hot chocolate.</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.933" end="00:48:42.733" style="s2">Doctor&#39;s orders.</p>
<p begin="00:48:44.800" end="00:48:45.933" style="s2">To second chances.</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.533" end="00:48:53.133" style="s2">And to knowing when not to give a third.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
